ADDITIONAL TERMS

For institutions subject to Colombian regulations (Ley 594/2000, Acuerdo AGN 060/2001):
This system implements document registration, management, and retention requirements
as mandated by Colombian archival law. Users must configure retention schedules (TRD)
and disposition policies according to their institutional guidelines and legal obligations.

The authors/contributors make no warranty that this software meets your jurisdiction's
specific requirements. Consultation with legal/compliance teams is mandatory before
production deployment.
